{"id":"8e3443388df2630d","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-thm-determinacy-cons.md","title":"Relative Consistency of AD + DC","display":"thm-determinacy-cons — Relative Consistency of AD + DC","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-determinacy-cons","aliases":["58-thm-determinacy-cons"],"display":"thm-determinacy-cons — Relative Consistency of AD + DC","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-consistency]]","[[../batch18/58-df-determinacy]]","[[../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal]]","[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-determinacy-cons"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-determinacy-cons</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-determinacy-cons — Relative Consistency of AD + DC"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency\">../batch13/58-df-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4cc4baec9297fd1e\" href=\"?note=4cc4baec9297fd1e\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-determinacy\">../batch18/58-df-determinacy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"164488c69fed4a7f\" href=\"?note=164488c69fed4a7f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal\">../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal\">../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span> (syntactic-consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency\">../batch13/58-df-consistency</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}\\)</span> (a fixed sentence code asserting an increasing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-sequence of Woodin cardinals below a measurable cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathrm{AD}}\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathrm{AD}}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathrm{DC}}\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathrm{DC}}\\)</span> (fixed sentence codes for the axiom of determinacy and dependent choice)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZFC}\">\\(\\operatorname{ZFC}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZF}\">\\(\\operatorname{ZF}\\)</span> (the corresponding recursively axiomatized theory codes in the membership language)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}cons}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\n(\\operatorname{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}\\})\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\n(\\operatorname{ZF}\\cup\\{\\theta_{\\mathrm{AD}},\\theta_{\\mathrm{DC}}\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}cons}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\n(\\operatorname{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}\\})\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\n(\\operatorname{ZF}\\cup\\{\\theta_{\\mathrm{AD}},\\theta_{\\mathrm{DC}}\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The large-cardinal sentence code <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}\\)</span> says that there are infinitely many Woodin cardinals with a measurable cardinal above them.</li>\n<li>Fixed codes are used in the theory sets; external predicates such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Woodin}\">\\(\\operatorname{Woodin}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}_S\\)</span> are not inserted directly into quoted object syntax.</li>\n<li>This is a relative-consistency theorem proved in the metatheory, so its turnstile is marked accordingly. It does not assert the large-cardinal hypothesis in ZFC.</li>\n<li>The resulting determinacy theory contradicts AC but includes DC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-determinacy","status":"resolved","id":"4cc4baec9297fd1e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-determinacy]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"164488c69fed4a7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"b4fb7c1808c84d14","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_S$ (syntactic-consistency predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-consistency]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_{\\mathrm{AD}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_{\\mathrm{DC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ZF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}cons}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\n(\\operatorname{ZFC}\\cup\\{\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}\\})\n\\to\n\\mathrm{Con}_S\n(\\operatorname{ZF}\\cup\\{\\theta_{\\mathrm{AD}},\\theta_{\\mathrm{DC}}\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\theta_{\\mathrm{LC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Woodin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measurable}_S","display":false}],"bytes":1748,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4115","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-thm-determinacy-cons.md|58-thm-determinacy-cons]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["6996aaff4caeacce","4cc4baec9297fd1e","164488c69fed4a7f","b4fb7c1808c84d14"]}